{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power\u2014literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place looks like an old store on its last legs\u2026 but why is there such a vast and suspicious space hidden beneath the building? What exactly happened here?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Abandoned \u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Hunter is a single-player, first-person shooter with a twist: instead of bullets, you shoot coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters drop all kinds of coins when defeated, and those coins serve a double purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they\u2019re your ammunition and your currency. Use them wisely\u2014either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey\u2026 sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. \ud83d\ude09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Potion \u2013 Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Potion \u2013 Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Potion \u2013 Reveals the location of all coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champagne \u2013 Sacrifice half your HP for a short burst of double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Drink \u2013 Run faster, move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Junior Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/d6cf1a9e12a227a00cf3b5016741b07cb4e47267.jpg"},{"name":"Senior Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/a15c7266e139f3cee3b3083c628fc9b6cd52cb86.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/d8ce4c4a7d8cfa8d018d6ae895bd6287318ee0ab.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/8c3928fc3913dc5cfd4181408379a363c11099c8.jpg"},{"name":"God of War","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/9d407a59a512d39a9a1a42303e888a99219b40ae.jpg"},{"name":"Richer Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/345900cfaebd2ab2b1d0a42e828db473e8e96918.jpg"},{"name":"Luxury Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/4642da9fc5ee1f04fb11f2ff38e08231e680efd9.jpg"},{"name":"Money is Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/9a231ab8b8fb20cb5299e8cd9c3da1d0c01f4a61.jpg"},{"name":"Art is Explosive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/7fa327aad25b16e11956a6288ea1a98611789e72.jpg"},{"name":"Physics is Amazing, Right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718660/98815faf19c126d121aae4ee83d135e3e7987238.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718660?t=1770747913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/cd210a3ce2c4fd7178a6f1ea548f8cf21cd4a406/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770747913","capsu