 and your currency. Use them wisely\u2014either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey\u2026 sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. \ud83d\ude09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Potion \u2013 Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Potion \u2013 Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul